  "details": "<p>The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: Skurcha GEO. BAtlas map places it to the north of the Hippos, after Arrian, which seems to correspond to the modern stream identified, in its lowest section, in OpenStreetMap as the \u041c\u0430\u043b\u044b\u0439 \u041a\u043e\u0434\u043e\u0440 (a stream named Skurcha being a further southeast tributary of the modern Kodori ( == Hippos).</p>",
